        "value_trust": {
          "type": "value",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Trust",
            "description": "<p>My Teddy is an established business with a registered business name, and ABN.  We openly list our address and our phone number on our website.  So you know who we are, where we are and that you can contact us should you need to.  These are important things to look for when choosing an online retailer.  We’ve established credibility in the industry over many years. </p>"
